     [2m  487 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  [39m[49m
     [2m  488 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  **Clock Divider Core Features** (`clk_divider_core.vhd`):[39m[49m
     [2m  489 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  - **Generic MAX_DIV**: Configurable maximum division ratio (default 256)[39m[49m
     [2m  490 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  - **Enable input**: Freeze/unfreeze counting (Priority: reset > enable > functional logic)[39m[49m
     [2m  491 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  - **div_sel encoding**: Linear mapping (0=÷1, 1=÷2, 2=÷3, ..., up to MAX_DIV)[39m[49m
     [2m  492 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  - **Clock enable output**: Generates clock enable pulses (not divided clock - safer for timing)[39m[49m
     [2m  493 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  - **Status register**: Shows current counter state[39m[49m
     [2m  494 [22m[48;2;34;92;43m[38;2;255;255;255m+  - **Testbench**: `tb/core/clk_divider_core_tb.vhd`[39m[49m
